{"parse":{"title":"Jade-Claimed Flower","pageid":187685,"revid":1803305,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Jade-Claimed Flower</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Talent_Jade-Claimed_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030117\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Jade-Claimed Flower\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Talent_Jade-Claimed_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030117\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Talent_Jade-Claimed_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030117 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/9/95/Talent_Jade-Claimed_Flower.png/revision/latest?cb=20221207030117 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Jade-Claimed Flower\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Jade-Claimed_Flower.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Jade-Claimed Flower.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">If <a href=\"/wiki/Hanega:_Song_of_the_Wind\" title=\"Hanega: Song of the Wind\">Hanega: Song of the Wind</a> comes into contact with <span class=\"text-hydro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Hydro\" title=\"Hydro\">Hydro</a></b></span>/<span class=\"text-pyro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Pyro\" title=\"Pyro\">Pyro</a></b></span>/<span class=\"text-cryo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo\" title=\"Cryo\">Cryo</a></b></span>/<span class=\"text-electro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Electro\" title=\"Electro\">Electro</a></b></span> when it is unleashed, this instance of the Windfavored state will obtain buffs according to the contacted element(s):<ul><li><span class=\"text-hydro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Hydro\" title=\"Hydro\">Hydro</a></b></span>: Kuugoryoku Point cap increases by 20.</li><li><span class=\"text-pyro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Pyro\" title=\"Pyro\">Pyro</a></b></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/ATK\" title=\"ATK\">ATK</a> increases by 30%.</li><li><span class=\"text-cryo\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Cryo\" title=\"Cryo\">Cryo</a></b></span>: <a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a> increases by 20%.</li><li><span class=\"text-electro\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/Electro\" title=\"Electro\">Electro</a></b></span>: When Normal and Charged Attacks hit an opponent, 0.8 <a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a> will be restored. Energy can be restored this way every 0.2s.</li></ul><br />You can have up to 2 different kinds of these buffs simultaneously.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/ATK_Increase\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ATK Increase\">ATK Increase</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/CRIT_Rate\" title=\"CRIT Rate\">CRIT Rate</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Energy\" title=\"Energy\">Energy</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Elemental Absorption\">Elemental Absorption</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Jade-Claimed Flower</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Wanderer\" title=\"Wanderer\">Wanderer</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Gameplay_Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gameplay Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Preview\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Preview</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gameplay_Notes\">Gameplay Notes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FJade-Claimed_Flower%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Elements affecting the Wanderer himself will also serve as sources for the buffs.</li>\n<li>Part of the Halo behind the Wanderer changes color based on the type of buff received.\n<ul><li>This visual indicator may disappear. However, the buff will remain.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<dl><dt><big>Constellation Effects</big></dt></dl>\n<ul><li>Constellation Level 1, <span class=\"item constellation\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\"><img alt=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Shoban Ostentatious Plumage.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c9/Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20221207030137\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\"><img alt=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Shoban Ostentatious Plumage.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/c/c9/Constellation_Shoban_Ostentatious_Plumage.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221207030137\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Shoban:_Ostentatious_Plumage\" title=\"Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage\">Shoban: Ostentatious Plumage</a></span></span>: \"When in the Windfavored state, the Attack SPD of the Wanderer's Kuugo: Fushoudan and Kuugo: Toufukai is increased by 10%. Additionally, the wind arrows fired by the Ascension Talent &#39;<a href=\"/wiki/Gales_of_Reverie\" title=\"Gales of Reverie\">Gales of Reverie</a>&#39; will deal an additional 25% of his ATK as DMG. You must first unlock the Ascension Talent &#39;Gales of Reverie.&#39;\"</li>\n<li>Constellation Level 4, <span class=\"item constellation\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" data-size=\"20\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yonban:_Set_Adrift_into_Spring\" title=\"Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring\"><img alt=\"Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Yonban Set Adrift into Spring.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Yonban_Set_Adrift_into_Spring.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Yonban_Set_Adrift_into_Spring.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20221218145940\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"mobile-only\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yonban:_Set_Adrift_into_Spring\" title=\"Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring\"><img alt=\"Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Constellation Yonban Set Adrift into Spring.png\" data-image-key=\"Constellation_Yonban_Set_Adrift_into_Spring.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/7/77/Constellation_Yonban_Set_Adrift_into_Spring.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221218145940\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"item-text\"> <a href=\"/wiki/Yonban:_Set_Adrift_into_Spring\" title=\"Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring\">Yonban: Set Adrift into Spring</a></span></span>: \"When casting <b>Hanega: Song of the Wind</b>, should the Passive Talent 'Jade-Claimed Flower' be triggered, the character will gain buffs in correspondence to the contacted Elemental Type(s), and also obtain a random untriggered buff. A maximum of 3 such corresponding elemental buffs can exist simultaneously. You must unlock the Passive Talent 'Jade-Claimed Flower' first.\"</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Preview\">Preview</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FJade-Claimed_Flower%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"preview\"><div class=\"hidden looppreview-hover-label\"><i>Hover over previews to view in higher quality.</i></div><div class=\"hidden looppreview-hover-preference\"><small>(<a href=\"/wiki/Special:Preferences#mw-prefsection-gadgets\" title=\"Special:Preferences\">Preview Preferences</a>)</small></div><div class=\"preview-gallery caption-center\"><span class=\"preview-gallery-item\"><span class=\"looppreview\"><figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 380px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2e/Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif/revision/latest?cb=20221204042941\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jade-Claimed Flower Preview\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"380\" height=\"211\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Jade-Claimed Flower Preview.gif\" data-image-key=\"Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2e/Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/380?cb=20221204042941\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2e/Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif/revision/latest?cb=20221204042941\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Jade-Claimed Flower Preview\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2e/Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/380?cb=20221204042941\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"380\" height=\"211\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Jade-Claimed Flower Preview.gif\" data-image-key=\"Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/2/2e/Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/380?cb=20221204042941\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Jade-Claimed_Flower_Preview.gif\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure></span></span></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FJade-Claimed_Flower%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span cla